# Cargo Workspace

## Layout

```
Cargo.toml          # workspace root when multiple crates exist
crates/<name>/      # member crates
lessons/<name>/     # lesson crates (bin or lib)
tests/              # integration tests for the crate they belong to
```

## Conventions

- Edition 2024 (or the edition pinned in workspace Cargo.toml)
- Pin versions in the workspace `[workspace.dependencies]` table
- Binary lessons live in `lessons/`; reusable code lives in `crates/`
- Do not commit `target/` or `Cargo.lock` for libraries unless this is a binary workspace

## Commands

| Goal | Command |
|------|---------|
| Check | `cargo check --workspace` |
| Test | `cargo test --workspace` |
| Lint | `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings` |
| Format | `cargo fmt --all` |
| Docs | `cargo doc --workspace --no-deps --open` |

## Constraints

- Do not add dependencies without stating why
- Prefer std before adding a crate
- Features are explicit; no implicit default-feature pileups
